/Title (Each participant is responsible for verifying and holding all the documents required for the trip and for entry into Bolivia, including: passport with at least six months' residual validity; any visa required according to nationality; onward or return ticket, where required; migration documentation; authorizations for minor participants; health or vaccination certificates as may be required according to nationality, origin, transits and itinerary.)
