/Title (Health and migration requirements may be changed by the authorities even at short notice. The client must therefore verify them again before departure with the competent consular and health authorities. The DMC will not be liable for consequences deriving from incomplete, expired, invalid or non-compliant documentation. Refusal of entry into the country or inability to participate due to lack of the required documents will be considered a no-show and will not entitle the client to any refund.)
