/Title (Arrival and transfer from Puno to Kasani, crossing the border into Bolivia. After lunch, we set off for La Paz, the capital of Bolivia, located at an altitude of 3,600 meters and clinging to the slopes of the Andes, with a stop at the impressive archaeological site of Tiwanaku and Puma Punku, one of the most important pre-Columbian civilizations in South America and a UNESCO World Heritage Site. An English-speaking guide will be with the group during the tour.)
